WEBVTT

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:03.080
The theme park sure was fun, wasn't it?

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:07.130
The roller coaster was so scary and such a rush!

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:14.580
It's too bad that I didn't become the hostage, but Anime Blue-sama was so, so cool!

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:19.910
Next, the haunted house was kinda scary and I got too excited and screamed!

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:23.130
The view from the ferris wheel, our final ride, was incredible.

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:26.400
It was really, really incredible!

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.340
I hope we can all go to the theme park again.

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:57.180
One more of the same. 
-Right away.

00:00:57.180 --> 00:00:59.710
Hey, you're drinking too much.

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:02.200
I can't take it anymore if I don't drink.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:06.610
You're the second wife of an influential city councilor.
What's there to complain about?

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:10.010
I guess. He's got loads of money.

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:13.650
But, the kids from his previous wife just piss me off.

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:15.910
They're twins, right?

00:01:15.910 --> 00:01:20.140
Those kids look at me as if I'm some kinda slut.

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:24.830
On top of that, it's strange that they've become so close since they became high schoolers.

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:28.690
At their age, I never even spoke to my sister.

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:31.640
Don't you think so too?

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:34.950
No idea. I don't have any siblings.

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:42.950
Hey, this isn't the way to the station.

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:46.860
I said that I'd walk you, but I didn't say to the station.

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:49.720
Then, where are you walking me to?

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:53.340
The bed. No, heaven, I guess.

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:59.760
Heaven

